// A notice a person can send again until it is filed. Each send again
// leaves a try behind, so the markings never repeat; nothing takes a try,
// and only [escalate] reads them, three at once, so the prover keeps three
// (ADR 0062) and the exploration ends. A third try lets the notice escalate.
net redelivery "A notice a person can send again until it is filed"

(pending) -> [send] -> (sent)
(sent) -> [redeliver] -> (pending)
[redeliver] -try-> (tries)
(sent) -> [finish] -> (done)
(sent) -> [escalate] -> (done)
@third: (tries) -try->? [escalate]
@third weight 3

final (done)
marking initial (pending) <- 1
